    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1084">

                <pb facs="0952" n="945" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg945"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.01/309: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-03T15:00:00+09:00">December 3, 1937—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 3—7 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>591. Our 583, November 30, 8 p.m.<anchor n="70" xml:id="d1084-f1"/> It was
                    officially announced yesterday that, following recognition by Japan of the
                    Franco regime, there occurred yesterday at Tokyo an exchange of notes between
                    the Manchukuo Ambassador and the Franco representative mutually extending
                    recognition.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
